[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0111","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1069","title":"Microsoft Windows Task Scheduler 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 任务计划服务在验证文件操作时存在链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59），攻击者利用该漏洞可通过符号链接替换技术将任务计划服务指向恶意文件，从而获取系统高权限。攻击条件为攻击者需先在目标系统上获得低权限代码执行能力，随后利用任务计划服务对文件操作校验不充分的缺陷，将普通权限提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows Server 2019 等多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危），微软已于 2019 年 6 月发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1069"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-12T14:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:45Z","remediation":"建议立即通过 Windows Update 安装 2019 年 6 月安全更新 (KB4503293/KB4503327/KB4503286/KB4503276/KB4503292 等)，或手动下载对应系统版本的累积更新包：Windows 10 1903 升级至 Build 18362.175 (KB4503293)；Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 Build 17763.557 (KB4503327)；Windows 10 1803 升级至 Build 17134.829 (KB4503286)；Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4503276；Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4503292。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 Task Scheduler 服务或限制非受信用户执行任务计划操作作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2019-1069","https://blog.0patch.com/2019/06/another-task-scheduler-0day-another.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1069","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/119704","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1069","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/S3cur3Th1sSh1t/SharpPolarBear"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0108","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1064","title":"Microsoft Windows AppX Deployment Service 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows AppX 部署服务 (AppXSVC) 存在特权提升漏洞，源于该服务在处理硬链接时存在缺陷。攻击者需先登录系统，随后运行特制应用程序利用该漏洞，可在提升的上下文中执行进程，进而安装程序、查看、更改或删除数据。该漏洞影响 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 7.8（高危），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度低、权限要求低、无需用户交互，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1064"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-12T14:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:44Z","remediation":"立即安装 Windows 10/11 版本 1809 及更高版本中的2019年10月或11月累积更新 (KB5031400 等)，或通过Windows Update启用安全更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表永久禁用AppXSVC服务 (reg add \"HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\AppXSVC\" /v \"Start\" /t REG_DWORD /d 4 /f)，或暂时停止服务 (net stop AppXSVC)，以临时缓解权限提升风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2019-1064","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1064","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1064","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2019-10647.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-1064.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/78706b5baefa79357f83155454b1df360a4a3b71/2019/CVE-2019-1064.json","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-1064.cs","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1064.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1064.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-10649.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-10647.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-10644.md","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/red-team/blob/1e53b7aa77717a22c9bd54facc64155a9a4c49fc/Information-Gathering/_on-host/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-1064.cs","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2019/CVE-2019-1064.json","https://github.com/RythmStick/CVE-2019-1064","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2019-1064","https://github.com/attackgithub/CVE-2019-1064"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0108.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0048","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12276","title":"GrandNode 路径遍历漏洞","description":"GrandNode 4.40 的 LetsEncryptController.cs 中存在路径遍历漏洞。远程未认证攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 `LetsEncrypt/Index?fileName=` HTTP 请求，利用该漏洞读取 Web 服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需任何身份认证或用户交互，仅需构造包含路径遍历序列的 fileName 参数即可触发。厂商已于 2019 年 5 月 30 日在 GrandNode 4.40 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12276"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-05T18:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:14:21Z","remediation":"升级 GrandNode 至 4.40 或更高版本，官方已于 2019 年 5 月 30 日发布补丁修复该路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 `LetsEncrypt/Index?fileName=` 路径的访问，并对 fileName 参数进行严格的路径合法性校验，禁止包含 `../` 等目录遍历序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153373/GrandNode-4.40-Path-Traversal-File-Download.html","https://github.com/grandnode/grandnode","https://grandnode.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47027","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12276.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12276.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12276.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-12276.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12276-3767.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12276-3768.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12276-3769.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12276-3765.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12276-3770.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-12276.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/GrandNode/CVE-2019-12276.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0106","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10149","title":"Exim 邮件服务器 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Exim MTA 在 4.87 至 4.91 版本中存在远程代码执行漏洞，根因是 src/deliver.c 中 deliver_message() 函数对收件人地址验证不当。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的收件人地址参数，在邮件投递过程中注入并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Exim 邮件服务器，CVSS 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互。成功利用可导致服务器完全沦陷，攻击者获取最高权限执行任意代码。Exim 官方已在 4.92 版本修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至 4.92 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10149"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-05T14:29:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:10:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 Exim 至 4.92 或更高版本（官方已修复该漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在 exim.conf 中添加 `smtp_accept_max_nonmail = 0` 限制非邮件命令，并配置防火墙仅允许受信 IP 访问 25 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-06/msg00020.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153218/Exim-4.9.1-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153312/Exim-4.91-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154198/Exim-4.91-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/16","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/05/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/05/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/05/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/06/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/07/25/6","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/07/25/7","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/07/26/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2021/05/04/7","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108679","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=CVE-2019-10149","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Jun/5","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201906-01","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4010-1/","https://www.debian.org/security/2019/dsa-4456","https://www.exim.org/static/doc/security/CVE-2019-10149.txt","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-10149","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46974","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-10149.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-10149.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-16928.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2019/CVE-2019-15846.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5b88724be1c7de19886a154d3ee7b7920c1a7674/2019/CVE-2019-10149.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/2019/CVE-2019-10149-Chris-dev1_exim.exp.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/2019/CVE-2019-10149-Brets0150_StickyExim.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/2019/CVE-2019-10149-qlusec_CVE-2019-10149.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-10149.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/2019/CVE-2019-10149-hyim0810_CVE-2019-10149.md","https://github.com/bananaphones/exim-rce-quickfix","https://github.com/Diefunction/CVE-2019-10149","https://github.com/cowbe0x004/eximrce-CVE-2019-10149","https://github.com/MNEMO-CERT/PoC--CVE-2019-10149_Exim","https://github.com/AzizMea/CVE-2019-10149-privilege-escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0043","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11370","title":"Carel pCOWeb 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Carel pCOWeb 存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞，由于程序未对用户输入的\"System contact\"等字段进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致具有低权限的认证攻击者可通过 config/pw_snmp.html 页面注入恶意脚本代码。当其他用户访问受影响页面时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中自动执行，窃取会话凭证或执行恶意操作。该漏洞影响 B1.2.4 之前版本的 pCOWeb 设备，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11370"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-03T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:12:47Z","remediation":"立即将 pCOWeb 卡固件升级至 B1.2.4 或更高版本（该版本已修复 SNMP 配置页面的输入过滤缺陷）。如无法立即升级，在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 /config/pw_snmp.html 及 /config/pw_snmp_done.html 的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 段访问 pCOWeb 管理界面，同时禁用 SNMP 写入功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://drive.google.com/open?id=1WkmtsCVNCtxwWH2fe9DtHow_Nedp1a7j","https://github.com/nepenthe0320/cve_poc/blob/master/CVE-2019-11370","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46897","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11370.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11370.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11370.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-11370.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2019/11xxx/CVE-2019-11370.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/carel/pcoweb_card_firmware/CVE-2019-11370.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11370.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-11370/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-11370.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-11370.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-11370.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-11370.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0053","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12593","title":"IceWarp Mail Server 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"IceWarp Mail Server 10.4.4 及之前版本在 webmail/calendar/minimizer/index.php 接口的 style 参数处理上存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含 ..\\ 等路径穿越序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器本地任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 IceWarp 邮件服务器所有受影响版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互，成功利用可导致敏感文件泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等），进而可能引发后续攻击。IceWarp 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至最新版本并限制相关接口的外部访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12593"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-03T17:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:14:55Z","remediation":"升级 IceWarp Mail Server 至 10.4.5 或更高版本以修复该目录遍历漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中通过访问控制规则拦截对 webmail/calendar/minimizer/index.php 的恶意请求，或在防火墙层限制外部对日历最小化功能的访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153161/IceWarp-10.4.4-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://github.com/JameelNabbo/exploits/blob/master/IceWarp%20%3C%3D10.4.4%20local%20file%20include.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46959","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12593.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12593.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12593.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-12593.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12593-3785.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12593-3788.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12593-3789.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12593-3787.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-12593-3790.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-12593.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12593.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0222","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11580","title":"Atlassian Crowd 及 Crowd Data Center 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Atlassian Crowd 及 Crowd Data Center 在发布版本中错误地启用了 pdkinstall 开发插件，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /crowd/admin/uploadplugin.action 端点发送特制 multipart 请求上传恶意插件包，从而在目标服务器上执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Crowd 2.1.0 至 3.4.4 之间的多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Atlassian 已在 3.0.5、3.1.6、3.2.8、3.3.5 及 3.4.4 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11580"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-03T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:11Z","remediation":"升级 Crowd/Crowd Data Center 至以下修复版本：3.0.x 升级至 3.0.5，3.1.x 升级至 3.1.6，3.2.x 升级至 3.2.8，3.3.x 升级至 3.3.5，3.4.x 升级至 3.4.4。如无法立即升级，可删除或禁用 pdkinstall 插件目录以防止插件上传利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163810/Atlassian-Crowd-pdkinstall-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108637","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/CWD-5388","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11580","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11580.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11580.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-11580-3748.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/crowd/CVE-2019-11580.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/c4f3f62fd2230bb894ed095a6e7da8142678ff2d/exploit/CVE-2019-11580.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2019-11580_RCE_漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-11580.js","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Atlassian Crowd/CVE-2019-11580 Atlassian Crowd RCE.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2019-11580 RCE 漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2019-11580.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11580.md","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-11580","https://github.com/shelld3v/CVE-2019-11580","https://github.com/DannyRavi/nmap-scripts"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0222.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1686","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-9875","title":"Sitecore anti CSRF 模块反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sitecore 内容管理系统（CMS）的 anti CSRF 模块中存在反序列化不可信数据漏洞（CWE-502）。经过身份认证的攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送包含特制序列化 .NET 对象的 HTTP POST 参数，触发不安全的反序列化操作，从而在目标服务器上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Sitecore 9.1 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有有效凭据方可利用，但无需用户交互。成功利用可导致服务器完全受控，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-9875"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-31T21:29:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:44:46Z","remediation":"立即将 Sitecore CMS/XP 升级到 9.1 Update-1 或更高版本（9.2/9.3/10.x）。如无法立即升级，可在 web.config 中禁用 AntiCSRF 模块（移除或注释 Sitecore.Security.AntiCSRF 相关配置），或在反向代理/WAF 层对 HTTP POST 参数 __CSRFTOKEN 添加反序列化内容过滤规则，阻止攻击载荷传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://dev.sitecore.net/Downloads.aspx","https://www.synacktiv.com/blog.html","https://www.synacktiv.com/ressources/advisories/Sitecore_CSRF_deserialize_RCE.pdf","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9875","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2019/CVE-2019-9875.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-98xx/CVE-2019-9875.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/7688320c57f11165f9e19f9d7d793764ad361406/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-9875","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-9875.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1685","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-9874","title":"Sitecore CMS和Sitecore XP 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sitecore CMS 7.0 至 7.2 及 Sitecore XP 7.5 至 8.2 版本的 Security.AntiCSRF 模块中存在 .NET 反序列化漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，在 __CSRFTOKEN 参数中携带恶意的序列化 .NET 对象触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。攻击者无需任何认证即可利用，危害严重，CVSS 评分 9.8。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-9874"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-31T21:29:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:44:46Z","remediation":"升级 Sitecore XP 至 8.2 Update-1 或更高版本（8.2 Update-7 为推荐稳定版），或升级 Sitecore CMS 至 8.2 Update-1 及以上版本。该漏洞通过 HTTP POST 参数 __CSRFTOKEN 传递序列化 .NET 对象触发，如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 __CSRFTOKEN 参数的外部请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://dev.sitecore.net/Downloads.aspx","https://www.synacktiv.com/blog.html","https://www.synacktiv.com/ressources/advisories/Sitecore_CSRF_deserialize_RCE.pdf","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9874","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9874.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9874.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2019/CVE-2019-9874.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9874.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9874.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9874.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/sitecore/experience_platform/CVE-2019-9874.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-9874.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-9874.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-9874.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9874.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1685.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0050","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12461","title":"Web Port 1.19.1 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Web Port 1.19.1 存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，位于 /log 页面的 type 参数中。攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL，诱使用户点击后，在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话 Cookie 或执行其他恶意操作。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接）。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。目前官方尚未发布修复版本，建议限制对 /log 页面的访问或对输入参数进行严格过滤。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12461"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-30T14:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:14:42Z","remediation":"升级 Web Port 至 1.19.2 或更高版本（官方下载页面：https://webport.se/nedladdningar/），该版本已修复此漏洞。如无法立即升级，对 /log 接口的 type 参数实施严格的输入验证和 HTML 实体编码输出转义，并配置 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158174/WebPort-1.19.1-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://emreovunc.com/blog/en/WebPort-Reflected-XSS-02.png","https://github.com/EmreOvunc/WebPort-v1.19.1-Reflected-XSS/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48611","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12461.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-12461-3782.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-12461-3781.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-12461-3783.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-12461-3778.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Web Port/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12461.yaml","https://github.com/EmreOvunc/WebPort-v1.19.1-Reflected-XSS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1684","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-9670","title":"Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"Zimbra Collaboration Suite 的 Autodiscover 服务存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Autodiscover/Autodiscover.xml 接口发送特制的 XML 请求，利用 XXE 漏洞读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、敏感数据），并可进一步结合 SSRF 漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Zimbra Collaboration Suite 8.7.x 系列 8.7.11p10 之前的所有版本，无需任何身份认证即可触发，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-9670"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-29T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:44:09Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zimbra Collaboration Suite 至 8.7.11p10 或更高版本（8.8.x 用户升级至 8.8.15 及以上），该补丁已在 bug#109129 中修复 Autodiscover servlet 的 XXE 问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 /Autodiscover/Autodiscover.xml 路径的外部访问，或禁用 XML 外部实体解析功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152487/Zimbra-Collaboration-Autodiscover-Servlet-XXE-ProxyServlet-SSRF.html","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/linux/http/zimbra_xxe_rce","https://bugzilla.zimbra.com/show_bug.cgi?id=109129","https://isc.sans.edu/forums/diary/CVE20199670+Zimbra+Collaboration+Suite+XXE+vulnerability/27570/","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Security_Advisories","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46693/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9670","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46693","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9670.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9670.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-9670.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-9670-4305.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/cve-2019-9670.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/pocs_yml/ymlFiles/zimbra-cve-2019-9670-xxe.yml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-9670/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-9670.py","https://github.com/orleven/Tentacle/blob/bc01b3d0d2f9a6117132f40e9098a16180335454/script/vul/zimbra/CVE-2019-9670.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Zimbra/CVE-2019-9670/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9670.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9670.py","https://github.com/rek7/Zimbra-RCE","https://github.com/attackgithub/Zimbra-RCE","https://github.com/Cappricio-Securities/CVE-2019-9670"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0025","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0221","title":"Apache Tomcat SSI printenv 命令跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 的 SSI printenv 命令存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该命令在输出用户提供的数据时未进行转义处理，导致攻击者可以构造恶意请求注入任意 JavaScript 代码。攻击者需要诱使已登录的管理员用户访问特制链接，在用户浏览器中执行恶意脚本，从而窃取会话 Cookie 或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 7.0.0 至 7.0.93、8.5.0 至 8.5.39 以及 9.0.0.M1 至 9.0.0.17 版本。SSI 功能默认关闭，printenv 命令仅用于调试，生产环境中通常不会启用，因此实际利用条件较为受限。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0221"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:01Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Apache Tomcat 7.0.94、8.5.40 或 9.0.18 及更高版本，官方已在该版本中修复 printenv 命令未转义输出导致的 XSS 漏洞。若暂时无法升级，由于 SSI 默认处于禁用状态且 printenv 命令仅用于调试，应保持 SSI 禁用，并通过修改 web.xml 中 ssi-enabled 参数为 false 或删除相关的 .shtml 处理配置来彻底关闭服务端包含功能；如业务确需启用 SSI，请移除所有使用 printenv 指令的 .shtml 页面，并确保在代理或 Web 应用层对用户可控参数进行 HTML 实体转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-06/msg00090.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-07/msg00054.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163457/Apache-Tomcat-9.0.0.M1-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/May/50","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108545","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:3929","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:3931","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6e6e9eacf7b28fd63d249711e9d3ccd4e0a83f556e324aee37be5a8c%40%3Cannounce.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r3bbb800a816d0a51eccc5a228c58736960a9fffafa581a225834d97d%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r48c1444845fe15a823e1374674bfc297d5008a5453788099ea14caf0%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r6ccee4e849bc77df0840c7f853f6bd09d426f6741247da2b7429d5d9%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r6d03e45b81eab03580cf7f8bb51cb3e9a1b10a2cc0c6a2d3cc92ed0c%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9136ff5b13e4f1941360b5a309efee2c114a14855578c3a2cbe5d19c%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/raba0fabaf4d56d4325ab2aca8814f0b30a237ab83d8106b115ee279a%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2019/05/msg00044.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2019/08/msg00015.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/NPHQEL5AQ6LZSZD2Y6TYZ4RC3WI7NXJ3/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archi