,"published":"2019-05-16T19:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 Windows 10/11 的最新安全更新（至少升级到 2023 年 6 月累积更新或更高版本），或确保已安装 Microsoft 2024 年 8 月安全更新包（KB 编号：4522938 及以上），并启用 Windows Defender 实时保护。此外，由于这一 GDI RCE 漏洞影响 GDI+ 对象处理，可临时通过注册表 DisableDWORD 值关闭 GDI+ 功能来缓解风险，或通过组策略禁用 Windows 照片查看器等使用 GDI+ 的应用，待补丁部署后再恢复功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0903","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0903","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0903.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0903.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0903.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0903.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/722d7f304bdff5198e6628e428db4bb3057c598c/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-0903.md","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/b71fadde1b7e978c5ddefd15cc4442bd1ed5b1e5/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-0903","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0903.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0903.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0903.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/e38001df9bf9b1d701d1fa79eee303ad0735eb5d/2019/CVE-2019-0903/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0077.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0077.toml"],"has_poc":t